{
  "id": "E308",
  "title": "Be More Buddha-Style",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-03-24",
  "synopsis": "“Buddha-style” is the number one Chinese Buzzword of 2018.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1000/094b25ed4431643bf1f0dad7800c5f62780aa6b3.mp3?1552124962",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "佛系一点吧\n\n小乐：保罗，明天的汉语考试你准备好了吗？\n保罗：还没有。\n小乐：那你还在玩游戏？你也太佛系了吧！\n保罗：没关系。不要着急，还有一个晚上呢。佛系一点！\n小乐：你自己去佛系吧。我去学习了！",
    "traditional": "佛系一點吧\n\n小樂：保羅，明天的漢語考試你準備好了嗎？\n保羅：還沒有。\n小樂：那你還在玩遊戲？你也太佛系了吧！\n保羅：沒關係。不要著急，還有一個晚上呢。佛系一點！\n小樂：你自己去佛系吧。我去學習了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Be More Buddha-Style"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：保罗，明天的汉语考试你准备好了吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：保羅，明天的漢語考試你準備好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bǎo luó míng tiān de hàn yǔ kǎo shì nǐ zhǔn bèi hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Paul, have you prepared for tomorrow’s Chinese test?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：还没有。",
      "traditional": "保羅：還沒有。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hái méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Not yet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：那你还在玩游戏？你也太佛系了吧！",
      "traditional": "小樂：那你還在玩遊戲？你也太佛系了吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nà nǐ hái zài wán yóu xì nǐ yě tài fó xì le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Are you still playing games? You are too Buddha-style!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：没关系。不要着急，还有一个晚上呢。佛系一点！",
      "traditional": "保羅：沒關係。不要著急，還有一個晚上呢。佛系一點！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó méi guān xi bú yào zháo jí hái yǒu yí ge wǎn shang ne fó xì yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s okay. Don't worry. I still have the entire night. Be more Buddha-style!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：你自己去佛系吧。我去学习了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你自己去佛系吧。我去學習了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zì jǐ qù fó xì ba wǒ qù xué xí le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You can be Buddha-style on your own. I will go to study!"
    }
  ],
